        <span class="inline-block w-8 h-px bg-accent-300/70"></span> Ready when it reopens
      </p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold text-white leading-[1.08]">
        One page. Every answer for your panda day.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-warm-200 text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Tickets, the keeper program, transport, and the best time to go — all reader-verified. Plan now so you're first in line when the gates reopen.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
