      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ ABOUT / CONTACT ============ -->
  <section id="about" class="scroll-mt-28 bg-warm-950 py-20 md:py-28 reveal">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <p class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-accent-300 uppercase mb-4">
        <span class="inline-block w-8 h-px bg-accent-300/70"></span> About This Guide
      </p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-white leading-[1.08]">An independent, reader-verified guide</h2>
      <div class="mt-7 space-y-4 text-warm-300 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Dujiangyan Panda Base Guide is an independent travel resource created to help international travelers plan their visit. We are <strong class="text-warm-100">not affiliated</strong> with the official base or any government tourism organization.
        </p>
        <p>
          We keep prices, hours, and booking information accurate by revisiting our content regularly, monitoring official channels, and incorporating feedback from readers and past volunteers. Time-sensitive information on this page was last verified <strong class="text-warm-100">July 2026</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-10 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-warm-800 bg-warm-800">
        <div class="p-8 bg-warm-900">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-white">Have a correction or a story?</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-warm-300">Spotted outdated info or volunteered at a panda base? We welcome corrections and guest stories — they keep this guide accurate.</p>
          <EmailLink class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent-500 text-white font-medium text-sm hover:bg-accent-600 transition-colors" />
        </div>
        <div class="p-8 bg-warm-900">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-white">Official matters</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-warm-300">For volunteer bookings, visiting permits, or official information, contact the China Conservation and Research Center for the Giant Panda directly — <a href="https://panda.org.cn/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent-300 hover:text-white underline">panda.org.cn</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
